# Implement User Selection with Name/Surname

The user wants to select task promoters, assignees, and subtask owners using their name and surname (or email) from the database. Currently, the [User](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/schemas/user.py#13-21) model lacks name fields, and the frontend only shows emails.

## Proposed Changes

### Backend

#### [MODIFY] [models/user.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/models/user.py)
- Add `name` (String, nullable=True) and `surname` (String, nullable=True) columns.

#### [MODIFY] [schemas/user.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/schemas/user.py)
- Update [UserBase](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/schemas/user.py#4-9) or [User](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/schemas/user.py#13-21) schemas to include `name` and `surname`.

#### [MODIFY] [crud/user.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/crud/user.py)
- Update [create_user](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/crud/user.py#16-33) to accept and save `name` and `surname`.

#### [MODIFY] [init_admin.py](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/backend/init_admin.py)
- Update admin creation to include default name/surname (e.g., "Admin", "User").

### Frontend

#### [MODIFY] [CreateTaskModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/tasks/CreateTaskModal.tsx)
- Update [fetchUsers](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/tasks/EditTaskModal.tsx#113-121) or the rendering logic to display `${user.name} ${user.surname}` or fallback to `user.email`.

#### [MODIFY] [EditTaskModal.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/components/tasks/EditTaskModal.tsx)
- Apply the same rendering logic changes.

### Admin UI

#### [MODIFY] [MainLayout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/layouts/MainLayout.tsx)
- Import [useAuth](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Documents/Coding/SynapsePlan/frontend/src/context/AuthContext.tsx#155-162) and `AdminPanelSettingsIcon`.
- Conditionally add "Admin" navigation item if `user.is_superuser` is true.
- Update profile section to display actual user name and "Admin" role if applicable.

